      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neno lililomjia Yeremia kutoka kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu wakati Nebuzaradani kapteni wa walinzi wa mfalme, alipomruhusu Yeremia aondoke Rama. Huyo kapteni alimchukua Yeremia amefungwa minyororo, akawachukua pia pamoja naye mateka wengine wote wa Yerusalemu na Yuda ambao walikuwa wamepelekwa uhamishoni Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapteni wa walinzi alimchukua Yeremia, akamwambia “Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, alitangaza maafa dhidi ya mahali hapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sasa Mwenyezi-Mungu ametekeleza jambo hilo na kutenda kama alivyosema, kwa sababu nyinyi nyote mlimkosea Mwenyezi-Mungu na kukataa kumtii, jambo hilo limewapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya! Leo nazifungua pingu mikononi mwako. Kama unaona ni vema kwenda pamoja nami mpaka Babuloni, basi twende pamoja; mimi nitakutunza vizuri. Lakini kama unaona si vizuri kwako kwenda pamoja nami mpaka Babuloni, basi, usije. Ujue kwamba waweza kwenda popote katika nchi hii; basi nenda popote unapoamua kuwa pazuri kwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama ukiamua kubaki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kama … kubaki:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maana katika Kiebrania si dhahiri.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " basi rudi kwa Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, mjukuu wa Shafani, ambaye mfalme wa Babuloni amemteua kuwa mtawala wa miji yote ya Yuda, ukakae naye miongoni mwa wananchi wengine. La sivyo, nenda popote unapoona ni sawa kwenda.” Basi, kapteni wa walinzi akampa Yeremia masurufu na zawadi, kisha akamwacha aende zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Yeremia akaenda Mizpa kwa Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, akakaa naye pamoja na wananchi waliobaki nchini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makapteni wote wa majeshi kutoka bara pamoja na watu wao, waliposikia kwamba mfalme wa Babuloni alikuwa amemtawaza Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, kuwa mkuu wa nchi, na kwamba alikuwa amemkabidhi wanaume, wanawake na watoto, yaani watu mafukara kabisa katika nchi ambao hawakuchukuliwa uhamishoni Babuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "walimwendea Gedalia huko Mizpa. Watu hao walikuwa Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, Yohanani na Yonathani wana wa Karea, Seraya mwana wa Tanhumethi, wana wa Efai kutoka Netofa, na Yezania mwana wa Maakathi; wote waliandamana na watu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia aliapa mbele yao na mbele ya majeshi yao akisema: “Msiogope kuwatumikia Wakaldayo. Kaeni nchini mumtumikie mfalme wa Babuloni, na mambo yote yatawaendea vema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nitakaa Mizpa niwawakilishe nyinyi kwa Wakaldayo watakaofika kwetu; lakini nyinyi kusanyeni na kuhifadhi divai, matunda ya kiangazi na mafuta, mkae katika miji mnayoimiliki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pia watu wa Yuda waliokuwa nchini Moabu na miongoni mwa Waamoni na nchini Edomu na nchi nyingine, waliposikia kwamba mfalme wa Babuloni alikuwa amewaruhusu watu wa Yuda wengine kubaki Yuda na kwamba alikuwa amemweka Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, mjukuu wa Shafani, kuwa mtawala wao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wote walirudi kutoka mahali pote walipokuwa wametawanyika na kwenda katika nchi ya Yuda kwa Gedalia huko Mizpa. Walichuma zabibu na matunda ya kiangazi kwa wingi sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yohanani mwana wa Karea pamoja na viongozi wote wa majeshi kutoka bara, walifika kwa Gedalia, huko Mizpa, wakamwambia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Je, una habari kwamba Baali mfalme wa Waamoni, amemtuma Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, akuue?” Lakini Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, hakuamini maneno yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Yohanani mwana wa Karea, akazungumza na Gedalia kwa faragha huko Mizpa, akamwambia, “Acha niende nikamuue Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, na hakuna mtu yeyote atakayejua. Kwa nini yeye akuue na watu wa Yuda wote waliokusanyika hapa watawanyike na Wayahudi waliobaki waangamie?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, akamwambia Yohanani mwana wa Karea, “Usifanye jambo hilo! Mambo unayosema juu ya Ishmaeli si ya kweli!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
